(6542085, 973557, 96751, '<td valign="top">How incredibly beautiful.  However, as I recently had occasion to see a swan up close and personal, I feel that the one in this image is proportionally WAY too small when compared to the ducky.  A greater size discrepancy would have added to the "looking up to" quality.  Great use of flood!</td>', 'How incredibly beautiful.  However, as I recently had occasion to see a swan up close and personal, I feel that the one in this image is proportionally WAY too small when compared to the ducky.  A greater size discrepancy would have added to the "looking up to" quality.  Great use of flood!', '2011-09-16 12:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
