(6542483, 973545, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, think the moon detracts though. Not sure if it was part of the original image or whether you added it as an additional layer?</td>', 'Lovely image, think the moon detracts though. Not sure if it was part of the original image or whether you added it as an additional layer?', '2011-09-16 20:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542522, 973474, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think this is real. I''m guessing a second mirror (off camera) was used. Very interesting image with the key and heart pendants.</td>', 'I think this is real. I''m guessing a second mirror (off camera) was used. Very interesting image with the key and heart pendants.', '2011-09-16 20:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542524, 973519, 66384, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! This certainly looks real, but I can see how it could be fake. Good choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous! This certainly looks real, but I can see how it could be fake. Good choice for the challenge.', '2011-09-16 21:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542530, 973317, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am thinking this is definitely expert editing, but what a fine editing job and what a lovely image. I truly adore it! Its also funny how the two images fit together, one so serene while the other is dark and moody. Top marks from me.</td>', 'I am thinking this is definitely expert editing, but what a fine editing job and what a lovely image. I truly adore it! Its also funny how the two images fit together, one so serene while the other is dark and moody. Top marks from me.', '2011-09-16 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542531, 973510, 27133, '<td valign="top">Not real.  Edges of wings are too sharp and the focus is on gulls head and waterdrops so the wings should be in focus as well.<br/> <br/>Okay if this is real then it has been cropped way to heavy causing the muting on the wings.</td>', 'Not real.  Edges of wings are too sharp and the focus is on gulls head and waterdrops so the wings should be in focus as well. Okay if this is real then it has been cropped way to heavy causing the muting on the wings.', '2011-09-16 21:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542534, 973602, 115307, '<td valign="top">My guess is advanced. I am a little confused by the brown tinge on both sides of the picture. What is its purpose?</td>', 'My guess is advanced. I am a little confused by the brown tinge on both sides of the picture. What is its purpose?', '2011-09-16 21:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542536, 973225, 115307, '<td valign="top">So, I have tried for 5 minutes to get the 3D effect, and the result is my eyes hurt and I didn''t see anything. But thankyou for keeping me entertained.</td>', 'So, I have tried for 5 minutes to get the 3D effect, and the result is my eyes hurt and I didn''t see anything. But thankyou for keeping me entertained.', '2011-09-16 21:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542538, 973509, 115307, '<td valign="top">Too obviously Expert editing in my opinion. I highly doubt you (or aquarium officials) would let your daughter jump into an aquarium like that sjhuls ;-). That being said, you did a great job imitating the effect with the ruffled skirt and flowing hair. Great editing job</td>', 'Too obviously Expert editing in my opinion. I highly doubt you (or aquarium officials) would let your daughter jump into an aquarium like that sjhuls ;-). That being said, you did a great job imitating the effect with the ruffled skirt and flowing hair. Great editing job', '2011-09-16 21:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542539, 973555, 115307, '<td valign="top">My guess is advanced.<br/>Neat picture.</td>', 'My guess is advanced.Neat picture.', '2011-09-16 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542545, 973474, 69324, '<td valign="top">The angle of the necklace is slightly different, which under most circumstances would never of been noticed.  Great tones, nice work.</td>', 'The angle of the necklace is slightly different, which under most circumstances would never of been noticed.  Great tones, nice work.', '2011-09-16 21:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542549, 973613, 59737, '<td valign="top">looks to me like a lot of the people were placed into the scene lots of cameras pointing all different directions but maybe that''s what it''s like at ground zero, haven''t been there</td>', 'looks to me like a lot of the people were placed into the scene lots of cameras pointing all different directions but maybe that''s what it''s like at ground zero, haven''t been there', '2011-09-16 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542554, 973606, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool image. It looks like a cracked filter in front of some bushes and an umbrella. I''m guessing it''s real.</td>', 'Cool image. It looks like a cracked filter in front of some bushes and an umbrella. I''m guessing it''s real.', '2011-09-16 21:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542555, 973449, 66384, '<td valign="top">While I know you are very good at staging this type of optical illusion, i''m guessing you did this one digitally, because it looks like you removed whatever you used to support yourself. BTW, I love the curtain and the sepia tone.</td>', 'While I know you are very good at staging this type of optical illusion, i''m guessing you did this one digitally, because it looks like you removed whatever you used to support yourself. BTW, I love the curtain and the sepia tone.', '2011-09-16 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542556, 973225, 51793, '<td valign="top">OMG that is sooooooo Cool. <br/> <br/>I hope others read the title and don''t just vote on the picture. <br/> <br/>Did you do anything special to make it do that? <br/> <br/>Send me a message, because I don''t don''t get on here much anymore and if you reply to comment I will never see it.</td>', 'OMG that is sooooooo Cool.  I hope others read the title and don''t just vote on the picture.  Did you do anything special to make it do that?  Send me a message, because I don''t don''t get on here much anymore and if you reply to comment I will never see it.', '2011-09-16 21:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542557, 973232, 66384, '<td valign="top">I suppose this could be done in PP with a filter, but I''m guessing you used real water to create this pretty image.</td>', 'I suppose this could be done in PP with a filter, but I''m guessing you used real water to create this pretty image.', '2011-09-16 21:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6542558, 973503, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fake.</td>', 'Fake.', '2011-09-16 22:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
