(6543558, 973559, 125275, '<td valign="top">Twins! Ok maybe not, I will say digital composite.<br/> <br/>Um..I must know. "24 hr video surveillance and security patrol"...did you get harassed for this?? Haha</td>', 'Twins! Ok maybe not, I will say digital composite. Um..I must know. "24 hr video surveillance and security patrol"...did you get harassed for this?? Haha', '2011-09-17 20:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
