(6543562, 973026, 125275, '<td valign="top">Wow, those horns are huge! I am going to guess the one on the left is a statue. A statue that was created in Photoshop. Am I right? (I might have to change my answer on this.)</td>', 'Wow, those horns are huge! I am going to guess the one on the left is a statue. A statue that was created in Photoshop. Am I right? (I might have to change my answer on this.)', '2011-09-17 20:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6543563, 973497, 125275, '<td valign="top">My guess is those beams of light were added in post processing. If you used a mask for this, I might have progressively blurred the mask as you got higher; light has a tendency to disperse as it travels. If you still have the psd, try it and see! If I''m wrong, I need to brush, my breath smells like foot. :)</td>', 'My guess is those beams of light were added in post processing. If you used a mask for this, I might have progressively blurred the mask as you got higher; light has a tendency to disperse as it travels. If you still have the psd, try it and see! If I''m wrong, I need to brush, my breath smells like foot. :)', '2011-09-17 20:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
