(6545681, 973474, 6519, '<td valign="top">This one is my favourite - well done!. I would say it is real, because the posture/chains aren''t identical, but then again you could have done that just to fool us. In either case, I love the feel, the mood, the tones, as well as the idea.</td>', 'This one is my favourite - well done!. I would say it is real, because the posture/chains aren''t identical, but then again you could have done that just to fool us. In either case, I love the feel, the mood, the tones, as well as the idea.', '2011-09-19 22:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545682, 973225, 6519, '<td valign="top">I ADORE those 3D shots - thanks for giving me one to look at!</td>', 'I ADORE those 3D shots - thanks for giving me one to look at!', '2011-09-19 22:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545683, 973585, 6519, '<td valign="top">This would HAVE to be a "fake", but in either case, it is very well done. One of my two top choices for this challenge.</td>', 'This would HAVE to be a "fake", but in either case, it is very well done. One of my two top choices for this challenge.', '2011-09-19 22:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545684, 972671, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and an excellent choice for the challenge - I am having a hard time deciding if this is fake or real. I can see quite easily how it could be done either way, or even be a bit of both - i.e. start off with a starburst from a small aperture, then exaggerate it via Photoshop. I think I''ll go with that option  :-)</td>', 'Nice shot and an excellent choice for the challenge - I am having a hard time deciding if this is fake or real. I can see quite easily how it could be done either way, or even be a bit of both - i.e. start off with a starburst from a small aperture, then exaggerate it via Photoshop. I think I''ll go with that option  :-)', '2011-09-19 22:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545685, 973583, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene and I like the subtlety here. In a very gentle, pretty way you could be fooling us with the rainbow. In either case, I like the end result.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene and I like the subtlety here. In a very gentle, pretty way you could be fooling us with the rainbow. In either case, I like the end result.', '2011-09-19 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545694, 973555, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is a very compelling shot - it drew me in and kept my attention right away.<br/>I''d say it is a fake because there are some angles that don''t look right, including her eyes.... she doesn''t seem to be looking in the right spot.<br/>In either case, I find it an interesting image.</td>', 'This is a very compelling shot - it drew me in and kept my attention right away.I''d say it is a fake because there are some angles that don''t look right, including her eyes.... she doesn''t seem to be looking in the right spot.In either case, I find it an interesting image.', '2011-09-19 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545696, 973543, 6519, '<td valign="top">This looks real to me. It is difficult to judge distances in a 2D medium, so what looks dangerous, is possibly/probably far from it.<br/>I like the composition and the tones.</td>', 'This looks real to me. It is difficult to judge distances in a 2D medium, so what looks dangerous, is possibly/probably far from it.I like the composition and the tones.', '2011-09-19 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545724, 973515, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy what the texture of the background brings to this photo.</td>', 'I really enjoy what the texture of the background brings to this photo.', '2011-09-19 23:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6545734, 973545, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2011-09-19 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
