(6546054, 973473, 66384, '<td valign="top">This definitely looks real, although I suppose you could have combined shots. From the standpoint of evaluating the image, I find the red cast on the foreground troublesome. Also there is a white area around the lower part of the fisherman, which might indicate that he was added to the scene and/or the color of the sky was manipulated. So I''m going to say NOT REAL.</td>', 'This definitely looks real, although I suppose you could have combined shots. From the standpoint of evaluating the image, I find the red cast on the foreground troublesome. Also there is a white area around the lower part of the fisherman, which might indicate that he was added to the scene and/or the color of the sky was manipulated. So I''m going to say NOT REAL.', '2011-09-20 13:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546058, 973382, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I think you used a star filter on your camera to get the starry lights, but I believe various images were combined to create this magical scene. NOT REAL</td>', 'This is lovely. I think you used a star filter on your camera to get the starry lights, but I believe various images were combined to create this magical scene. NOT REAL', '2011-09-20 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546060, 973555, 66384, '<td valign="top">It is a weird reflection, and I believe this is a setup REAL scene -- well done.</td>', 'It is a weird reflection, and I believe this is a setup REAL scene -- well done.', '2011-09-20 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546065, 973441, 66384, '<td valign="top">My goodness, does anyone have such beautiful hair? I guess so, because I think this scene is REAL.</td>', 'My goodness, does anyone have such beautiful hair? I guess so, because I think this scene is REAL.', '2011-09-20 13:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546068, 973510, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this many times in nature, so I guessing it is REAL. Although I know it is extremely hard to capture this moment.</td>', 'I''ve seen this many times in nature, so I guessing it is REAL. Although I know it is extremely hard to capture this moment.', '2011-09-20 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546070, 973032, 66384, '<td valign="top">Since they are both numbered 32, I''m going to say this is MANIPULATED.</td>', 'Since they are both numbered 32, I''m going to say this is MANIPULATED.', '2011-09-20 13:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546073, 973386, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been to Lego Land, so I don''t know if there are life-sized legos there. Could be real under those circumstances, or could be shopped. You have me stumped.</td>', 'I''ve never been to Lego Land, so I don''t know if there are life-sized legos there. Could be real under those circumstances, or could be shopped. You have me stumped.', '2011-09-20 14:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546075, 973457, 66384, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''d say this has been SHOPPED, since I''m not sure how you would get such a dreamy soft focus on the entire landscape, while the boy is so sharp. I really like the image, however it was created.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''d say this has been SHOPPED, since I''m not sure how you would get such a dreamy soft focus on the entire landscape, while the boy is so sharp. I really like the image, however it was created.', '2011-09-20 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546079, 972749, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think this has been MANIPULATED, because I don''t believe it is possible to male a heart-shaped soap bubble.</td>', 'I think this has been MANIPULATED, because I don''t believe it is possible to male a heart-shaped soap bubble.', '2011-09-20 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546080, 972901, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, you caught them, now we know they are real -- or are they. :) I''m going to guess NOT REAL.</td>', 'Ha ha, you caught them, now we know they are real -- or are they. :) I''m going to guess NOT REAL.', '2011-09-20 14:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546081, 973515, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a hilarious idea. Very political, unique, creative and wonderfully executed. I like how the shape of the figure seems to show up in the outline of shadow in the reflection. I think this is photoshopped, mainly because the pawns look "selected" out of their background. I''m also unable to match up the reflection of the king to the actual figure.</td>', 'This is a hilarious idea. Very political, unique, creative and wonderfully executed. I like how the shape of the figure seems to show up in the outline of shadow in the reflection. I think this is photoshopped, mainly because the pawns look "selected" out of their background. I''m also unable to match up the reflection of the king to the actual figure.', '2011-09-20 14:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546084, 973510, 132251, '<td valign="top">The wing on the right looks super processed. I am leaning toward the bird was PS''ed in.</td>', 'The wing on the right looks super processed. I am leaning toward the bird was PS''ed in.', '2011-09-20 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546087, 973589, 66384, '<td valign="top">I suppose you could have had a trampoline, but that would be very dangerous for the kid to use it with a pointy object in his hand and floppy shoes. I think he probably jumped off of something out of the frame -- still dangerous though. However, I''m going to guess REAL.</td>', 'I suppose you could have had a trampoline, but that would be very dangerous for the kid to use it with a pointy object in his hand and floppy shoes. I think he probably jumped off of something out of the frame -- still dangerous though. However, I''m going to guess REAL.', '2011-09-20 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546088, 973604, 66384, '<td valign="top">Certainly looks REAL, although I don''t know why there is a lamp post out in the middle of nowhere, and in the middle of the path.</td>', 'Certainly looks REAL, although I don''t know why there is a lamp post out in the middle of nowhere, and in the middle of the path.', '2011-09-20 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546091, 973583, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think it is REAL, because the sun is low enough to produce a rainbow, and the sky is gray enough to have the required mist or rain. Love the scene with all those identical boats in a row.</td>', 'I think it is REAL, because the sun is low enough to produce a rainbow, and the sky is gray enough to have the required mist or rain. Love the scene with all those identical boats in a row.', '2011-09-20 14:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546092, 973577, 132251, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, I don''t know (or care) if it is real or PS''d. I just like it... If I had to guess I''d say "real".</td>', 'I like this shot, I don''t know (or care) if it is real or PS''d. I just like it... If I had to guess I''d say "real".', '2011-09-20 14:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546094, 973503, 132251, '<td valign="top">Unless that girl was really there in your world of "cross-stitch", then I am going to say "Photoshopped".</td>', 'Unless that girl was really there in your world of "cross-stitch", then I am going to say "Photoshopped".', '2011-09-20 14:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546095, 973317, 66384, '<td valign="top">Could be accomplished with waterproof housing for your camera or a glass wall at an aquarium. I''m going to guess REAL because it looks so unreal.</td>', 'Could be accomplished with waterproof housing for your camera or a glass wall at an aquarium. I''m going to guess REAL because it looks so unreal.', '2011-09-20 14:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546098, 972844, 132251, '<td valign="top">Could be an overlay or a simple relflection on a street. I''ll go with a reflection, "real" Wait a minute! the "kelly salon" seems to be "on top" of the reflection. FAKE!</td>', 'Could be an overlay or a simple relflection on a street. I''ll go with a reflection, "real" Wait a minute! the "kelly salon" seems to be "on top" of the reflection. FAKE!', '2011-09-20 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6546102, 972354, 132251, '<td valign="top">Not much to go on here... Not impossible to be either way... The grain looks alittle fishy though, so I''ll say "Photoshopped"</td>', 'Not much to go on here... Not impossible to be either way... The grain looks alittle fishy though, so I''ll say "Photoshopped"', '2011-09-20 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
