(6547722, 973225, 94815, '<td valign="top">I''v e done a lot of this stuff including imagery interpretation in the US Army. But this image is too large for any normal person to perform this feat except with an old stereocoptic viewer. So I tried. Still to large. Printed and reduced to 1/3 size might work in a viewer or less to make is work  manually.. er.. visually. Nice try for the challenge.</td>', 'I''v e done a lot of this stuff including imagery interpretation in the US Army. But this image is too large for any normal person to perform this feat except with an old stereocoptic viewer. So I tried. Still to large. Printed and reduced to 1/3 size might work in a viewer or less to make is work  manually.. er.. visually. Nice try for the challenge.', '2011-09-21 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
