(6547772, 973613, 94815, '<td valign="top">Well I know it''s faked because the pavement never looked so clean in this place outside the WTC PATH train entrance. Brilliant collection of NYC characters in proper perspective and evenly bland lighting even the blue guy. (Yes there are superheroes in NYC.) I especially like the pair of heavy hotties posing for you and I know I''ve seen that preacher up in Times Square. Must have taken an incredible amount of time and PS effort. I envy your skills.</td>', 'Well I know it''s faked because the pavement never looked so clean in this place outside the WTC PATH train entrance. Brilliant collection of NYC characters in proper perspective and evenly bland lighting even the blue guy. (Yes there are superheroes in NYC.) I especially like the pair of heavy hotties posing for you and I know I''ve seen that preacher up in Times Square. Must have taken an incredible amount of time and PS effort. I envy your skills.', '2011-09-21 23:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
