(6549436, 973519, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> Another stunner, Brin. Would you mind telling me where this is? I was in Iceland this summer and though I didn''t plan anything out due to chronic disorganization, I was hoping to run across this beauty. Never did. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Scott<br/>Yes this is taken on Skógarströnd near Snæfellsnes on the west cost of Iceland. I hope you''ll find it in your next visit, if not you can contact me :)<br/>Thanks for the comment.<br/>Bragi (Brin)</td>', 'Originally posted by bohemka: Another stunner, Brin. Would you mind telling me where this is? I was in Iceland this summer and though I didn''t plan anything out due to chronic disorganization, I was hoping to run across this beauty. Never did.   Hi ScottYes this is taken on Skógarströnd near Snæfellsnes on the west cost of Iceland. I hope you''ll find it in your next visit, if not you can contact me :)Thanks for the comment.Bragi (Brin)', '2011-09-23 20:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
