(6550706, 973392, 59737, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, really happy with the result for both the challenge and the picture.  Enjoyed taking the shot even if my wife and daughter thought I was losing it.  The editing wasn''t anything too crazy, I think because I stood next to a black background and it made selecting very easy.  Then it was just a matter of inverting the mask a few time to get the look I wanted.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, really happy with the result for both the challenge and the picture.  Enjoyed taking the shot even if my wife and daughter thought I was losing it.  The editing wasn''t anything too crazy, I think because I stood next to a black background and it made selecting very easy.  Then it was just a matter of inverting the mask a few time to get the look I wanted.', '2011-09-25 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
